{"chars": "Not all of Santa's reindeer pull the sleigh on Christmas Eve. The barn is home to a whole herd, a big reindeer family. There was Evenstar, the oldest and wisest of them all, with a silvery face and gentle eyes. Long ago, she pulled Santa's sleigh herself, and now she watches over the whole family. There was Whistler, who made a little whistling sound when she was excited. There was Bramble, sturdy and brave, with a coat as brown as chocolate. There was Starbloom, sweet and gentle, with a white spot on her forehead shaped like a star. And there was Lilt, the youngest of all, small and springy, with ears a bit too big for her head. Lilt was much too young to fly, but she dreamed about it every single night.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.425, 0.425, 0.425, 0.425, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 0.7, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.125, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.738, 1.738, 1.738, 1.738, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 1.863, 2.212, 2.212, 2.212, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.375, 2.875, 2.875, 2.875, 2.875, 3.6, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.7, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 3.8, 4.088, 4.088, 4.088, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.2, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.575, 4.575, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.65, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 4.9, 5.375, 5.475, 5.475, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.575, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 7.025, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.125, 7.263, 7.263, 7.263, 7.263, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 7.438, 8.15, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.387, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.787, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 8.9, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.412, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 9.6, 10.025, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.1, 10.238, 10.238, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.338, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 11.2, 11.2,